{"chunk_id": "3e5b7938671d", "text": "Lakshmana is ordered to guard the door so that Rama may speak privately with a mysterious ascetic whose message must be heard by no one else. The visitor reveals his true identity: he is Death itself, once a son of the cosmic Grandsire (Brahma), sent to deliver a divine message. Brahma declares that Rama\u2019s mission on earth is fulfilled. The speech recalls the primordial acts of the divine\u2014creation from the lotus arising from Vishnu\u2019s navel, the slaying of Madhu and Kaitabha, and the sustaining of the worlds. It also reminds Rama that he incarnated as a man to destroy Ravana when the demon threatened all beings. The moment reframes Rama not merely as a king but as Vishnu incarnate whose earthly role is nearing completion.\nDeath, sent by Brahma, tells Rama his divine mission is fulfilled and reminds him of his origin as Vishnu who incarnated to destroy Ravana.\nThemes: divine identity, mission fulfilled, cosmic creation, avatar of Vishnu, destiny and mortality", "vector": [0.0116832684725523, -0.022964337840676308, -0.015426326543092728, -0.0056210728362202644, 0.01599719189107418, 0.01170273032039404, -0.040816839784383774, -0.020408419892191887, -0.02309408038854599, 0.004433933645486832, 0.023158950731158257, 0.01277958881109953, -0.00585136516019702, -0.0012252512387931347, 0.0020418150816112757, -0.00036794025800190866, 0.04188072308897972, -0.019928373396396637, 0.04847161844372749, -0.013752654194831848, 0.0016606978606432676, -0.004768019076436758, 0.006123823579400778, 0.009341425262391567, -0.020447341725230217, 0.0007172300829552114, 0.013337479904294014, -0.02664901129901409, 0.02078467234969139, -0.01905910298228264, 0.0006519536254927516, -0.021563123911619186, -0.016542106866836548, -0.0025851097889244556, -0.023626022040843964, 0.015387403778731823, 0.0021310127340257168, -0.0066946884617209435, 0.013097456656396389, -0.015192790888249874, 0.012649847194552422, -0.014310545288026333, 0.0064384476281